#SCADA StrangeLove Default/Hardcoded Passwords List
#Find more at http://www.scada.sl
#Please contact us at scadastrangelove@gmail.com and @scadasl

SCADA StrangeLove Default/Hardcoded Passwords List
==================================================

A curated list of default and hardcoded credentials for ICS/SCADA equipment:
PLCs, DCS, RTUs, HMIs, SCADA software, industrial network gear, protection
relays and building automation systems. Every entry carries a source URL
(vendor documentation or security research).

Files
-----

- scadapass.csv       - the main list: 341 entries, 107 vendors.
                        Columns: Vendor, Device, Default password, Port,
                        Device type, Protocol, Source.
- scadapass_fixed.csv - companion list of FIXED/ELIMINATED default passwords:
                        devices that no longer ship with a usable shared
                        default (forced first-login change, unique per-device
                        label passwords, vendor-patched hardcoded creds).
                        Do not list these as having working defaults.

Release 1.3 (October 2026)
--------------------------

First major update since 2016: +126 new entries covering 2016-2026.

- PLC/DCS:        Siemens SCALANCE XM/XR, RUGGEDCOM ROS/NMS; Rockwell Stratix,
                  PanelView; Schneider Modicon M580, Easergy P3, PowerLogic
                  PM5500, Altivar dPAC; ABB Relion 615/REX615/REX640; Emerson
                  ROC800/FB107; Honeywell Experion (mngr:mngr1), ControlEdge;
                  Mitsubishi, Omron, Beckhoff, WAGO PFC, Bosch Rexroth ctrlX,
                  CODESYS, Phoenix Contact mGuard/PLCnext; Unitronics Vision
                  (1111, per CISA AA23-335A)
- SCADA/HMI:      Ignition, Advantech WebAccess, Weintek EasyBuilder Pro,
                  JCI Metasys, Siemens Desigo CC/PXC, GE EnerVista
- Networking:     Moxa (MX-NOS, NPort, ioLogik, MXview), Teltonika RutOS,
                  Sierra Wireless AirLink, Ewon Flexy/Cosy+, Red Lion
                  Crimson/N-Tron, Cisco IE, Hirschmann HiOS, InHand
- Power/relays:   SEL relays and RTAC (OTTER/TAIL/CLARKE), GE Multilin UR,
                  Eaton PXG/PXM
- BMS:            Tridium Niagara 4 (JACE-8000/9000, Edge 10), Honeywell WEBs,
                  Distech ECLYPSE
- Hardcoded CVEs: Emerson DeltaV (CVE-2022-29962..65), Honeywell ControlEdge /
                  Safety Manager, Yokogawa STARDOM and CENTUM VP
                  (CVE-2025-7741)

New entries are sourced from official vendor documentation and security
research (CISA ICS advisories, CVEs); the Source column in most new entries
is prefixed with [official] / [research].

